{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一个评估时刻的特征值。\n\n- `value`：必填；`None` 表示显式\"不可计算\"（历史不足等），不填补；\n- `inputs_used`：计算该值实际使用的观察条数；为 0 当且仅当 `latest_input_available_time` 为空，\n  且此时 `value` 必须为 `None`（零输入的值只能是填补）；\n- `latest_input_available_time`：所用观察中最大的 `available_time`，不晚于 `evaluation_time`\n  （带 `available_lag` 的完整约束由 `FeatureResult.check_answers` 检查）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.5.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "evaluation_time": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Evaluation Time",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "value": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Value"
    },
    "inputs_used": {
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Inputs Used",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "latest_input_available_time": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Latest Input Available Time"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "evaluation_time",
    "value",
    "inputs_used"
  ],
  "title": "FeatureValue",
  "type": "object"
}
